 846 02133 7510         SPA             /SKIP IF RESULT POSITIVE
 847 02134 7020         CML             /RESULT NEG COMP LINK FOR TEST
 848 02135 7420         SNL             /SKIP IF WRAP OCCURRED
 849 02136 2320         ISZ XADDD       /TAKE SECOND RETURN
